@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary DeliverablesManagementInterface
control DeliverablesController
control DeliverablesService
control NotificationService
database Database

== Deliverables Management ==

Lecturer -> DeliverablesManagementInterface: Request list of project deliverables
DeliverablesManagementInterface -> DeliverablesController: GET /api/deliverables
DeliverablesController -> DeliverablesService: Retrieve project deliverables
DeliverablesService -> Database: Fetch project deliverables
Database --> DeliverablesService: Return project deliverables
DeliverablesService --> DeliverablesController: Return project deliverables
DeliverablesController --> DeliverablesManagementInterface: Return project deliverables

Lecturer -> DeliverablesManagementInterface: View deliverable details
DeliverablesManagementInterface -> DeliverablesController: GET /api/deliverables/{deliverableId}
DeliverablesController -> DeliverablesService: Fetch deliverable details
DeliverablesService -> Database: Fetch deliverable details
Database --> DeliverablesService: Return deliverable details
DeliverablesService --> DeliverablesController: Return deliverable details
DeliverablesController --> DeliverablesManagementInterface: Return deliverable details

Lecturer -> DeliverablesManagementInterface: Remove deliverable
DeliverablesManagementInterface -> DeliverablesController: DELETE /api/deliverables/{deliverableId}
DeliverablesController -> DeliverablesService: Remove deliverable
DeliverablesService -> Database: Delete deliverable
Database --> DeliverablesService: Return deletion status

alt Removal successful
    DeliverablesService -> NotificationService: Notify student of removal
    NotificationService -> StudentEmail: Send removal notification
    NotificationService --> DeliverablesService: Return notification status
else Removal failed
    DeliverablesService --> DeliverablesController: Return error status
end

DeliverablesService --> DeliverablesController: Return removal status
DeliverablesController --> DeliverablesManagementInterface: Return deliverables management status

@enduml
